    "description": "写操作：创建一个自建测试campaign(命名test+HHMMSS)，验证成功后立即调用/api/Campaigns/delete清理，不留存测试脏数据。不使用ES真实客户样本的campaign内容，仅参照其字段结构。【实测踩坑】新建的campaign默认是active/花费中状态，直接delete会报\"Delete is not allowed on a spending campaign\"业务规则错误，必须先PUT bulk暂停(enabled:false)才能删除，已在steps里补上暂停步骤。【实测发现】Instacart对campaign name做永久唯一性校验，即使campaign已被delete，同名也无法再次创建(报错Name is a duplicate)，不是软删除释放名字；因此改用新的时间戳名避免和上一轮测试冲突，这是平台真实行为，非测试脚本问题。【注意】由于平台对campaign name做永久唯一性校验(已在Excel/记忆里记录)，本次case每次重跑前都需要手动换一个新时间戳名字，否则会报Name is a duplicate(不影响其他判断，属已知平台行为)。",
    "module": "Campaigns",
    "granularity": "API",
    "since": "init",
    "last_modified": "init",
    "change_type": "NEW",
    "generated_by": "swagger-api-case",
    "steps": [
      {
        "name": "创建campaign",
        "method": "POST",
        "base_url": "{{base_urls.INSTACARTBASEURL}}",
        "headers": "{{headers}}",
        "path": "Campaigns",
        "request_body": {
          "profileId": "{{variables.profile_id}}",
          "name": "test2026final692383",
          "startDate": "2026-09-27",
          "endDate": null,
          "budget": "100",
          "targetdailyBudget": null,
          "objective": "awareness",
          "BudgetType": "0"
        },
        "extract_vars": {
          "new_campaign_id": "data.campaignId"
        },
        "expected_response": {
          "code": 200,
          "data": {
            "campaignId": {
              "$not_empty": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "清理准备：先暂停campaign(删除前置条件)",
        "method": "PUT",
        "base_url": "{{base_urls.INSTACARTBASEURL}}",
        "headers": "{{headers}}",
        "path": "Campaigns/bulk",
        "request_body": [
          {
            "IsUpdateCampaignStatus": true,
            "profileId": "{{variables.profile_id}}",
            "campaignId": "{{new_campaign_id}}",
            "enabled": false
          }
        ],
        "extract_vars": {},
        "expected_response": {
          "code": 200
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "清理：删除刚创建的campaign",
        "method": "POST",
        "base_url": "{{base_urls.INSTACARTBASEURL}}",
        "headers": "{{headers}}",
        "path": "Campaigns/delete",
        "request_body": [
          "{{new_campaign_id}}"
        ],
        "extract_vars": {},
        "expected_response": {
          "code": 200,
          "data": {
            "successCount": 1
          }
        }
      }
    ]
